  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Integration of Climate Change Adaptation Solutions in Niger</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to contribute to strengthening the resilience of Nigerien communities to climate change by promoting adaptation practices. It materializes at the community level the political and knowledge production approach initiated since 2020 as part of the project. Specifically targeting communities identified during the realization of the national study, this project constitutes a pilot in that it comes to strengthen the capacity for action of political decision-makers, practitioners and communities in terms of adaptation to climate change, in the localities, departure and arrival of environmental migrants in Niger.</narrative>
  </description>
